{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Potion Worm</i>, you play as Wit Azel, a young herbalist trying to survive in the wilderness and earn enough money to escape a strange, isolated village. Explore dangerous 2D forests, dodge monsters, gather herbs, mushrooms, and even worms, hire mercenaries for protection, brew potions using collected ingredients, and sell your creations to the locals. There's no direct combat \u2014 only dodging, smart planning, and risky exploration. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753860?t=1748584914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753860/92326d912c692861b76fc7252fe0bae76748eac0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748584914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753860/893292a349c604374a1e23ba1eb606c485167751/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748584914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753860/893292a349c604374a1e23ba1eb606c485167751/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748584914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Potion Worm</i>, you play as Wit Azel, a young herbalist trying to survive in the wilderness and earn enough money to escape a strange, isolated village. Explore dangerous 2D forests, dodge monsters, gather herbs, mushrooms, and even worms, hire mercenaries for protection, brew potions using collected ingredients, and sell your creations to the locals. There's no direct combat \u2014 only dodging, smart planning, and risky exploration. </p>","developers":["Alifirov Vladislav"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https:/